Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.84,0:00:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)粉碎吧，贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)太好了，鲨鱼赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.33,0:00:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能，我居然输了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那时候一样啊，贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.28,0:00:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}曾经在这地方对决的时候也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙在决斗中落败{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后被你杀害怀着怨恨与憎恶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这世间徘徊的亡者们一起……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.03,0:01:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坠入了地狱。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.85,0:01:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，开什么玩笑，我……！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.77,0:01:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)那、那是什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住、住手，住手～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论哪个时代，邪恶都会沉溺于自身的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.81,0:01:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自取灭亡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那时候别把我和你混为一谈！纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的我 已经超越了七皇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甚至连千尊主都超越了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.53,0:01:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我要消失 你也得一起陪葬！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 竟然还有 这样的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.51,0:02:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为神的我的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(千尊主)别搞错了 贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(千尊主)这
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不是你的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊主！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 应该已经被我烧尽了才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.82,0:02:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(千尊主)愚蠢的贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为我会被那种程度干掉吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都是在等待这个时机到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.02,0:02:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时机已到。贝库塔你已经没用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份力量全部归我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要 我不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 才不想死在这种地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.83,0:04:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)你想干什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:05:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 超火大的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.83,0:05:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？ 撑住！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别松手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要救身为敌人的贝库塔吗？\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.99,0:05:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你也会被吸进去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这样我也不能见死不救啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手 游马 那家伙没有心！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算救了他 也只会再次背叛而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那又怎样… 那又怎样再相信一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果没有心的话那就等到有心为止 我一直相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的 热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 就算是你也有一颗善良的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你还是真月的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是那么开朗爱多管闲事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是我 还是大家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都最喜欢你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:06:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你真正的样子就是真月零！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是真月…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.87,0:06:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 你就是真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以和我重新开始吧 真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就 跟我一起上路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟我一起死吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.93,0:06:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 到这边来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 好啊 真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.55,0:06:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会让你一个人的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会保护你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.51,0:06:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((从今天起 你就是我们的同伴了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.73,0:06:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们不会抛弃任何人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会保护你的))
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.49,0:07:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个老好人。蠢死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可没法拉你一起上路。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵这样一来贝库塔的力量就归我所有了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不可原谅 千尊主！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已取回力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:07:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么，这次又会发生什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧新世界的黎明！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这究竟是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已成为了一个世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻地上世界与巴利安世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因我的力量而融合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回头看看吧，九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.39,0:08:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错就是你们所居住的地上世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过了吧我已成为了一个世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.26,0:09:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔。快斗他，快斗他真的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 快斗在战胜我之后力竭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 在银河眼诞生的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他将这张卡托付给了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 No.龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的遗物 我将它托付给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……可是 为什么给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗所托付 所相信的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.39,0:09:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.07,0:09:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们七皇身为人类时的记忆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被上千主上篡改
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坠入了异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让那家伙复活成为他的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上所创造的未来中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有我们所期望的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔 你！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无需插手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧我的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了巴利安之力的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢向我挑战吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.45,0:10:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向取回了神之力的我。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…那就是唐·萨赞多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.62,0:10:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的姿态！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.79,0:10:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·萨赞多…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，堂堂正正地一决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也成为我的食粮吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:10:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.09,0:11:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻由我来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样结束回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都不做就结束回合吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.35,0:11:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，轮到你了尽管放马过来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.03,0:11:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我倾尽全身全灵的决斗你就接下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.18,0:11:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤防霸龙 赫利俄斯菲尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡银河逆鳞！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合通过放弃战斗阶段{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将等级4以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙族怪兽1只特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，半月龙 拉迪乌斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的赫利俄斯菲尔和拉迪乌斯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.16,0:12:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}显现吧，银河星尘龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 星际龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.13,0:12:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个超量单元取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将1只龙族怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将超量单元全部取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这2只怪兽特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 极限龙 舒瓦尔茨希尔特！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星间龙 秒差距！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！ 一转眼就有3只怪兽了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.86,0:12:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 米扎艾尔这个回合 没法战斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不。那家伙恐怕……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·千 看好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:13:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 龙使者的最后王牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.80,0:13:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡发动 龙皇的崩御！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 是将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将怪兽全部释放。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，释放的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.23,0:13:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力合计{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方玩家受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！米扎艾尔，你……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算和唐·萨赞德同归于尽吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手，米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.67,0:13:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以我的性命为代价龙族们的羁绊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.19,0:13:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你送回地狱！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃下4800的伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔啊好好看看你的场地吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！愚蠢的卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙皇的宝札？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡牌改变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.31,0:14:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？我发动的明明是龙皇的崩御才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 在你的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动的是 龙皇的宝札。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的龙族怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部解放……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从卡组抽那个数量的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 解放的怪兽攻击力合计数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.55,0:14:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有我会受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你输了 米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此你将受到4800的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.41,0:14:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！ 为什么要做那种乱来的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也想试着相信了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.45,0:15:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信快斗和你们所相信的那份相信他人的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.87,0:15:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修 游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的就交给你们了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，剩下的七皇就只剩你一个了，纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，你也到我的身边来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.89,0:15:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的体内，已经
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有着数十亿巴利安的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这其中也包括在这场战斗中消散的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的同伴们啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有，星光体，九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的灵魂，我也收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至此，我将得到所有的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为真正的神。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这里开始谁都无法逃脱。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们就一起成为我的食粮吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，献祭的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.95,0:16:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想把我们一并……是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要跟我们决斗吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔他……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他用生命向我们传达了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要相信他人，跨越敌我的隔阂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是该挺身对抗强大敌人的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼，还有游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起战斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼，一起上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:17:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我为同伴报仇雪恨！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊主，来做最后的了断吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔，我一直在等待着这一刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你在我面前跪下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.12,0:17:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你打得粉碎之时。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样结束回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是什么都不做。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。小心点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·千是至今为止
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗过的对手中 最强的敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且这场决斗 肯定有什么蹊跷。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:18:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。上了！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 夜骑士特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己场上没有怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.81,0:18:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我再召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级4的夜骑士和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识见识 百万千万！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我们的希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.47,0:18:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些家伙 以为会有那种东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(霍普)呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:19:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!? 霍普!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(顽皮骑士)顽 顽… 顽？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}顽皮骑士被召唤出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 你这家伙 做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从卡组发动反击陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动了 No.系觉醒。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.29,0:19:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组发动陷阱卡!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 是在我的回合!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张反击陷阱是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上没有卡的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方的超量召唤无效并破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从对方卡组中选一只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在对方场上特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过那个效果，我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改写了霍普召唤的事实。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改写……No.……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道这股力量是 No.代码！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会 为什么那家伙会！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 No.代码的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界已经在发动场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.网络了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.网络一回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己场上没有卡的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.22,0:20:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动获得 No.力量的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊 和米扎艾尔决斗的时候也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 凭借 No.网络的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.11,0:20:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动反击陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.44,0:20:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动了源数改写魔法。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.51,0:20:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将魔法的发动与效果无效，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为替代，从对方卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动满足发动条件的魔法卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.65,0:20:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 你就是用这招
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.08,0:20:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改写了米扎艾尔的卡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！ 卡要是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都能被改写的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.96,0:20:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他们可就…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 上千主上真的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.71,0:20:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掌握了源数代码的力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.33,0:20:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡现在还没有人集齐。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:20:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隐藏在地表世界某处的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.51,0:21:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}源数代码的所在…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 难道说 那种事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.99,0:21:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同地表世界一起努梅隆代码的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于察觉到了吗，阿斯特拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确，努梅隆代码的所在尚未知晓。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}于是吾将地上世界屏障化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.82,0:21:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同这个世界一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将努梅隆代码的力量吸收殆尽。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·萨赞德！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今的我获得了努梅隆代码的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.91,0:21:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已成为神！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来对阿斯特拉尔世界的直接攻击也成为可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.95,0:21:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔世界……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。而且在这场决斗中你们所受的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.34,0:21:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将会原封不动地倾泻到阿斯特拉尔世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，将你们与阿斯特拉尔世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:22:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同你们一起，把这阿斯托拉尔世界毁灭掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}努梅隆德基的力量在毁灭自身的同时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.02,0:22:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好品尝吧！

